A vibrant Vincent van Gogh style painting of a busy technology workshop classroom in Taipei, featuring rows of focused developers hunched over laptops with swirling, expressive brushstrokes in rich blues and warm yellows. In the foreground, an elegant traditional tea service with multiple ceramic vessels steaming with freshly brewed tea, painted with thick impasto texture. The scene blends Eastern and Western elements—modern screens glowing with code alongside delicate tea cups. Cypress-like swirls emanate from the steam, transforming into the iconic Van Gogh sky pattern above the classroom. The color palette features deep cobalt blues, golden ochres, and touches of jade green, with characteristic bold directional brushwork throughout the entire composition.
